{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vectoraid, you'll do more than just shoot asteroids though. You'll dodge gravity wells and black holes whilst grabbing power-ups and defending other ships. You'll also fight giant, screen-filling bosses that with unique mechanics to master. You'll die. A lot. But you'll also unlock permanent upgrades, ship skins and engine trail cosmetics and become stronger with every run. Enjoy the arcade style bullet hell gameplay in a neon CRT visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Retro Vector Graphics</u>:</strong> All visuals are drawn in real-time, authentically recreating the classic arcade feel with modern particle effects and CRT screen simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customise your ship</u>:</strong> At the start of each run you can choose from your unlocked ship skins and engine trails. And then select which special power to use out of 5, power up your special meter by destroying asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Physics-Based Chaos</u>:</strong> Master gravity wells, black holes, and wormholes to turn the environment into your ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.poster.avif?t=1760030064\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.webm?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.mp4?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>15 Levels</u>:</strong> Face off against 5 unique asteroid types (Armoured, Elite, Phased, Tethered &amp; more!), alien ships, and environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>5 Boss Battles</u>:</strong> Learn the unique mechanics to defeat 5 bosses, including the Colossus, Crystal Titan, the Alien Dreadship, and the final Super-Asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.poster.avif?t=1760030064\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.webm?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.mp4?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Power-up Arsenal</u>:</strong> Discover 11 unique power-ups that drop from enemies, from bombs and teleportation to spawning clones and detonating rainbow engine trails! Time your charged shot to combo with power-ups for extra effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/1f296c7cb6a6b906439646d62808135c.poster.avif?t=1760030064\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/1f296c7cb6a6b906439646d62808135c.webm?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/1f296c7cb6a6b906439646d62808135c.mp4?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gauntlet Mode</u>:</strong> Test your skills in an endless wave mode where survival unlocks exclusive cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Local 1v1 Duel</u>:</strong> Go head-to-head with a friend in a chaotic duel, spawning asteroids, meteors, and drone ships to crush your opponent!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082580?t=1760030064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082580?t=1760030064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/380e48a82001b0c5c9c6fad36ee27beb157c1e06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760030064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/380e48a82001b0c5c9c6fad36ee27beb157c1e06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760030064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vectoraid, you'll do more than just shoot asteroids though. You'll dodge gravity wells and black holes whilst grabbing power-ups and defending other ships. You'll also fight giant, screen-filling bosses that with unique mechanics to master. You'll die. A lot. But you'll also unlock permanent upgrades, ship skins and engine trail cosmetics and become stronger with every run. Enjoy the arcade style bullet hell gameplay in a neon CRT visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Retro Vector Graphics</u>:</strong> All visuals are drawn in real-time, authentically recreating the classic arcade feel with modern particle effects and CRT screen simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customise your ship</u>:</strong> At the start of each run you can choose from your unlocked ship skins and engine trails. And then select which special power to use out of 5, power up your special meter by destroying asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Physics-Based Chaos</u>:</strong> Master gravity wells, black holes, and wormholes to turn the environment into your ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.poster.avif?t=1760030064\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.webm?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/62fe4f1f78afa0de42f37f8c861e4a4f.mp4?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>15 Levels</u>:</strong> Face off against 5 unique asteroid types (Armoured, Elite, Phased, Tethered &amp; more!), alien ships, and environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>5 Boss Battles</u>:</strong> Learn the unique mechanics to defeat 5 bosses, including the Colossus, Crystal Titan, the Alien Dreadship, and the final Super-Asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.poster.avif?t=1760030064\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.webm?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.mp4?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Power-up Arsenal</u>:</strong> Discover 11 unique power-ups that drop from enemies, from bombs and teleportation to spawning clones and detonating rainbow engine trails! Time your charged shot to combo with power-ups for extra effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/1f296c7cb6a6b906439646d62808135c.poster.avif?t=1760030064\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/1f296c7cb6a6b906439646d62808135c.webm?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/1f296c7cb6a6b906439646d62808135c.mp4?t=1760030064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gauntlet Mode</u>:</strong> Test your skills in an endless wave mode where survival unlocks exclusive cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Local 1v1 Duel</u>:</strong> Go head-to-head with a friend in a chaotic duel, spawning asteroids, meteors, and drone ships to crush your opponent!</p>","developers":["James Suret"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/99189a9b528988b59de0c365ccd17e20d1a9e68c/header.jpg?t=1760030064","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM